{
  "id": "unique-event-024",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "unique-event-024:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#24 - Amusement park ride\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,1207,1233]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-024:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You show your ticket and a ghost\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,1233,1266]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-024:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "lets you climb into a funfair ride\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,1266,1301]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-024:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "leading into a cave. Everything is\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,1301,1336]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-024:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "made of plastic. Fake spider webs\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,1336,1370]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-024:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and skeletons hang from the walls.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,1370,1405]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-024:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The ride brings back nice\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,1405,1431]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-024:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "childhood memories and you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,1431,1458]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-024:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "recover 1 Sanity.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,1458,1476]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-024:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "On the seat next to you, you find a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,1476,1512]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-024:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "note, probably left by another\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,1512,1543]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-024:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "customer. “Walrus the Clown\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,1543,1571]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-024:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "haunts the old railway station. He\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,1571,1606]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-024:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "used to be a good soul but he is\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,1606,1639]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-024:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "controlled by the demonic rubber\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,1639,1672]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-024:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "mask he is wearing.”\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,1672,1693]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-024:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You leave the ride and go back to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,1693,1727]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-024:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "your exploration.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[86,1727,1745]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    86
  ]
}
